<< /A << /BBox [ 105.449 229.89 489.43 761.443 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Flowchart illustrating the proposed adaptive question recommendation framework. Student information, including GPA, engagement level, study hours, prior course experience, preferred assessment type, and course name, is provided as input to a machine learning model. The model predicts an anticipated difficulty level of Easy, Moderate, or Hard. The predicted difficulty, together with the course name and preferred assessment type, is used to retrieve a matching question from a faculty-created question bank. Faculty members create and assign question difficulty levels, while the system stores the question bank. The workflow ends by presenting the most appropriate question to the student.) /K 10 /Lang (en-EN) /P 279 0 R /Pg 192 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
